//! An ERC-4626 vault's accounting, written with Dimension.
//!
//! EIP-4626 fixes four roundings: deposit and redeem round down, mint and
//! withdraw round up. Here none of them is written down. Each operation names
//! the amount the caller gives and which way it moves, and `exchange` rounds
//! what the vault gives back by the opposite direction, so all four follow from
//! the operations' meaning. `contracts` deploys the previews for comparison
//! with OpenZeppelin's ERC4626.
